You've probably had a deal wobble because an inspector flagged the roof and nobody could say how bad it actually was.

{hook}

I can get out to a {city} property within a few days and give you and your client a straight answer in writing - repair, replace, or it's fine and the inspector was being cautious.

Want me on your list for the next one?

