first.body:
{greeting}

After a storm your clients ask you who to call, and recommending the wrong contractor comes back on you.

{hook}

We inspect, and when there's no real damage we say so - we don't talk people into filing claims that get denied. That protects your loss ratio as much as it protects them.

Can I be the name you give out around {city}?

followup.body:
{greeting}

I wrote about being a contractor you could hand clients to after a storm, and haven't heard back.

Is that already covered by someone you trust? If so, I'll leave it - I'd just rather know than keep writing.

breakup.body:
